# Voja, Jaws of the Conclave: "Whenever Voja attacks, put X +1/+1 counters on each creature you control, where X is the number of Elves you control. Draw a card
# for each Wolf you control." Bot1 attacks on turn 3 with Voja, a Llanowar Elves and a Young Wolf (X = 1: the one Elf; Voja and the Young Wolf are two Wolves, so
